From: Calvin Watford <cwatford@makenotion.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 19:36:27 -0700
Subject: test: update V8 serialization wire format version to 16

V8 14.9 (Chromium 149) bumped the serialization wire format from
version 15 to 16. Update the hardcoded expected bytes in the test.

Chromium's V8 also passes the Wasm jsapi WPT subtest "Calling setter
without argument" (global/value-get-set.any.js), which Node's V8 still
fails, so drop it from the expected failures.

Upstream Node will catch up on its next V8 roll; this patch can be
removed then.

